Z||000009||tgowens||11-16-2000||11:24 AM||||Welcome to the Forum Jackalrr!! (I lived in Cincinnati for 15 years up until a year ago!)<P>There are a few things you can do and some parts places I can recommend to you as well......call me here at the Fiero Shop sometime -- 1-510-233-4376 and we can talk about it........<P>not sure about the "pimpin" thing tho unless you want to put one of those little "gold crown air fresheners (ok guys, let's not start a major thread about <I>this</I> air freshener!) on top of the plenum or maybe put wide whitewalls and gold wire wheel covers on your GT (yes, they DO help increase the horsepower - kinda like putting stickers on your bumpers and windshield!).........<P>And.....Stimpy, how come you know the "lingo" so well? hmmmmmm???<P>Seriously Charlie, we do have fun on here but there is a lot of knowledge to be gained (and, there are several Fiero owners on here from right around there - Fiero56, WilliamThornIII, 87ECO5 and FieroWife are just a few - look them up, they are wonderful people!<P>------------------<BR>                 <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/tgowens_sig.gif">                             <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A> - Blue '87 GT - Gold '87 GT<BR><A HREF="http://www.cfog.org" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog.org</A> - Classic Fiero Owners Group<BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.net/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroshop.net/</A> - Fiero Shop - Richmond, CA - 1-510-23-FIERO||||reg||1
