Z||000013||DaRkLoRD||11-16-2000||05:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by RiceCooker:<BR><B>HAHAHA!!<BR>You guys are great!<BR>Anytime I'm havin a bad day or I can't pick up any broads on the street, I can just read the forum and laugh my a$$ off.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hmm.. back when I was younger (lol), we used to call them "chicks"... now people are referring to girls as "broads" again??? what gives? that's 1940s slang... and not too flattering, if I understand the origins of the term...<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
