Z||000015||Seanh||11-16-2000||05:59 PM||||I dont think thats what he ment by "pimp out the V6", but I am just assuming. Port the stock manifolds, go with a turbocharger if you can afford it, and for the money, stick in a 3.4 instead of buying that expensive rebuilt kit. I am doing a 3.4 soon.  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/transsig.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto<BR>Going on to 3.4 in Jan.<BR><I>"If you smoke after sex, you're doing it way to fast".</I>||||reg||1
Z||000016||Jackalrr||11-16-2000||09:21 PM||||For the love of god people, if i can't use the term "pimp out" or "soup up" what should I say??? BTW: I meant, make the SOB fast as a fly mofo in the back streets of the hood... or something like that. I want it to be fast, how is that? I want to go faster than the Audis and the ricers.||||reg||4
Z||000017||Seanh||11-16-2000||09:36 PM||||Well, I can see the members point of view here. Pimpin' out means somthing more like dressing up the engine in chorme and gold plating, maybe some 19" Wal-mart rims, cover the entire interior with white bed sheets, have a 13" color tv with combo VCR mounted where the glove box used to bet, and some spray painted swivel chairs.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I saw that '78 Car at a gas station in Grand Island. Honestly, it was the first "real" pimpin' car I had ever seen. I mean, I'v seen the ones at the huge car shows, all made nice and not completly like the real "on the street", "in the hood" type ones. Thats what Pimpin' means to most of us. A title like "Performance Improvments or Upgrades for the V6" probally would have been more intelegent. Faster then ricers, not a problem. Faster the Audi's, not without some major mod's. I know that one from a bad experience. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/transsig.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto<BR>Going on to 3.4 in Jan.<BR><I>"If you smoke after sex, you're doing it way to fast".</I>||||reg||1
