Z||000026||Got2manyfieros||11-17-2000||11:30 AM||||At the risk of answering your question: <A HREF="http://www.users.qwest.net/~racing2win/mild2wld.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.users.qwest.net/~racing2win/mild2wld.htm</A> <P>This page has some good stuff, you may also want to consider port matching your intake, it isn't that difficult and there is a lot of room for improvement.  ie: radius out the injector ports, port match all three pieces based on where the gasket ends in comparison to the metal, polish what you can reach.||||reg||1
